# Story: As a gate clerk, I want to check a truck in when it arrives, so that the terminal knows the container has come through the gate. Only clerks can check trucks in; a driver trying to check in is refused with FORBIDDEN. Check-in opens two hours before the slot starts (earlier attempts are refused with CHECKIN_TOO_EARLY) and a checked-in booking has the status CHECKED_IN.

@draft

Feature: Checking Trucks In by Gate Clerks

Scenario Outline: Check-in a Truck (Happy Path)
  Given I am a gate clerk
  And the truck arrives on time
  When I check the truck in
  Then the terminal knows the container has come through the gate
  And the booking status is CHECKED_IN

  Examples:
    | slot_start_time |
    | 10:00             |
