Scenario Outline: Check-in a Truck (Boundary Cases)
  Given I am a gate clerk
  When I check the truck in after the check-in window closes
  Then the outcome is refused because "CHECKIN_TOO_EARLY"

  Examples:
    | slot_start_time |
    | 17:00             |

Scenario Outline: Check-in a Truck (Error Cases)
  Given I am a gate clerk
  When I try to check in myself
  Then the outcome is refused because "FORBIDDEN"

  Examples:
